[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0010","text":"哇──\n这个巧克力蛋，是阳希酱做的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0020","text":"是把店里卖的巧克力重新加工了一下，路加酱要是愿意的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0030","text":"好厉害！\n里面还有带留言的巧克力板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0040","text":"嘿嘿，我给你们俩分别写了留言放进去的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0051","text":"留言"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0060","text":"“路加酱　一直谢谢你”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0070","text":"…………\n──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0080","text":"路加酱的那份写了什么呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600500_02_0100","text":"难道说……没看就直接吃掉了……？"}]
